==Battleground==
*1 [[Vendor El]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Vendor El]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Festive Otter]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The problem in this stage comes from how hard it is to stall for cash. Try your best to spam meatshields at the Vendor El, however, the Zoge makes this quite a bit tricky, so you can't stall forever. Try to get [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] as soon as you can, for it makes dealing with the rest quite a bit easier. The zombies from base hit are incredibly annoying, especially the Zories, but thankfully, you can send rushers out to trigger a base hit while Bahamut is in the back. If you can meatshield spam past the Vendor Els, Zories, and the Festive Otters, the Ritual Drum Doge falls easily.

